      "Text": "Security update for cockpit",
      "Title": "Topic",
      "Type": "Summary"
    },
    {
      "Text": "This update for cockpit fixes the following issues:\n\n- CVE-2026-91147: denial of service in `cockpit-ws` due to URL-root handling without a trailing slash (bsc#1281989).\n- CVE-2026-91149: denial of service via unbounded connection thread spawning (bsc#1281994).\n",
      "Title": "Details",
      "Type": "General"
    },
